### AttendanceAI — API Test File
### VS Code extension: REST Client (humao.rest-client)
### Usage: click "Send Request" above any request block
### Env variables are defined in .vscode/settings.json

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@aiUrl   = http://localhost:8000

### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### AUTH ENDPOINTS
### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 1. Register (student)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name":       "Test Student",
  "email":      "teststudent@university.edu",
  "password":   "TestPass1",
  "role":       "student",
  "department": "CS",
  "rollNumber": "CS21099"
}

###

### 2. Login as Admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email":    "admin@university.edu",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

###

### 3. Store the token from the login response above
# Copy accessToken from step 2 response and paste below
@adminToken = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

###

### 4. Login as Faculty
# @name loginFaculty
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email":    "faculty1@university.edu",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

###

@facultyToken = PASTE_FACULTY_TOKEN_HERE

### 5. Login as Student
# @name loginStudent
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email":    "cs21001@university.edu",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

###

@studentToken = PASTE_STUDENT_TOKEN_HERE

### 6. Get my profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### CLASS MANAGEMENT
### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 7. List all classes
GET {{baseUrl}}/classes
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 8. Create a class
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subjectCode":        "CS501",
  "subjectName":        "Cloud Computing",
  "department":         "CS",
  "semester":           5,
  "batch":              "A",
  "minAttendancePct":   75,
  "classroomLatitude":  28.7041,
  "classroomLongitude": 77.1025,
  "locationRadiusM":    100
}

###

### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### ATTENDANCE
### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 9. Start QR session (faculty)
# Replace CLASS_ID with a real class ObjectId from step 7
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{facultyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "classId":         "PASTE_CLASS_ID_HERE",
  "latitude":        28.7041,
  "longitude":       77.1025,
  "radiusMeters":    100,
  "durationMinutes": 90
}

###

### 10. Get student attendance summary
# Replace STUDENT_ID with a real student ObjectId
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance/students/PASTE_STUDENT_ID_HERE/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### ANALYTICS
### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 11. Admin overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/admin/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 12. At-risk students
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/admin/at-risk?riskLevel=warning&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 13. Department stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/admin/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 14. Leaderboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/leaderboard?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### USER MANAGEMENT (Admin only)
### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 15. List all students
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?role=student&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 16. Get user stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 17. Create a new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name":       "New Faculty Member",
  "email":      "newfaculty@university.edu",
  "password":   "Faculty@123",
  "role":       "faculty",
  "department": "CS",
  "employeeId": "F099"
}

###

### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### NOTIFICATIONS
### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 18. Send bulk alert to at-risk students
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/bulk-alert
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "riskLevel": "warning",
  "channel":   "email"
}

###

### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### AI SERVICE (direct — for testing)
### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 19. AI service health
GET {{aiUrl}}/health

###

### 20. Risk prediction — single student
POST {{aiUrl}}/predict/risk
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "student_id":                 "6613abc000000000000011",
  "overall_percentage":         65.0,
  "consecutive_absences":       4,
  "days_since_last_attendance": 6,
  "trend_delta_4w":             -3.5,
  "subject_records": [
    {
      "class_id":      "6613abc000000000000001",
      "subject_code":  "CS301",
      "total_classes": 24,
      "attended":      15,
      "percentage":    62.5,
      "weekly_trend":  []
    }
  ]
}

###

### 21. Model info
GET {{aiUrl}}/predict/model/info

###

### 22. Health check (backend)
GET http://localhost:3000/health

###
